§§ `Clause 1 — conditions precedent`
-- src:13 | 1. The due observance and fulfillment of the terms, conditions,
-- src:14 | exclusions and endorsements of this Policy by the Insured
-- src:15 | Person and claimant insofar as they relate to anything to be
-- src:16 | done or complied with them, and the truth of the statements
-- src:17 | and details in every application form and declaration shall be
-- src:18 | conditions precedent to any liability of the Company to make
-- src:19 | any payment under this Policy.
