§§ `Clause 3 — governing law`
-- Selects the law the Policy is read under; it adds or removes no condition of payment.
-- Inert, and it is why the Law on Insurance Business is consulted for the LAW forks.
-- src:24 | 3. This Policy shall be governed and construed in accordance
-- src:25 | with the laws of Vietnam and any dispute or difference that
-- src:26 | arises under this Policy shall be settled in accordance with the
-- src:27 | laws of Vietnam.
