-- src:1107 | pháp Việt Nam.

§§ `Clause 4 — a disclaimed claim not referred within 6 calendar months is abandoned`
-- src:28 | 4. If the Company disclaims liability for any claim hereunder
-- src:33 | and such claim is not referred to dispute resolution within 6
-- src:34 | calendar months from the date of such disclaimer, then the
-- src:35 | claim shall for all purposes be deemed to have been abandoned
-- src:36 | and shall not thereafter be recoverable hereunder.
-- src:1108 | 4. Nếu có bất kỳ yêu cầu bồi thường nào bị Công ty từ chối trách
-- src:1109 | nhiệm và yêu cầu bồi thường đó không được đưa ra giải quyết
-- src:1110 | tranh chấp trong vòng 6 tháng dương lịch kể từ ngày bị từ
-- src:1111 | chối, thì xem như yêu cầu bồi thường đó đã bị từ bỏ và sau đó
-- src:1112 | sẽ không được phục hồi vì bất cứ lý do gì.
-- `add months` keeps the day of the month and clamps it to the month's last day (31 August
-- + 6 months = 28 February). Fork F-MONTHS.
GIVEN `date of the disclaimer` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`clause 4 — the last day to refer a disclaimed claim to dispute resolution` `date of the disclaimer` MEANS
    `add months` `date of the disclaimer` 6

GIVEN d     IS A `The dates of a claim`
      `as at` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`clause 4 — the claim is deemed abandoned, as at` d `as at` MEANS
    CONSIDER d's `date the Company disclaimed liability`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST disclaimed THEN
        CONSIDER d's `date the claim was referred to dispute resolution`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `as at` GREATER THAN `clause 4 — the last day to refer a disclaimed claim to dispute resolution` disclaimed
        WHEN JUST referred THEN referred GREATER THAN `clause 4 — the last day to refer a disclaimed claim to dispute resolution` disclaimed

§§ `Clause 5 — what the Policy does not cover`

-- The limbs on which the two texts agree are excluded outright, or by the threshold both
-- texts print. Three limbs differ (NOTES.md §4):
--  5.3 the English excludes "mutiny or riot or civil commotion assuming the proportions of or
--      amounting to a popular rising"; the Vietnamese excludes civil commotion "do các bộ phận
--      trong nhân dân hoặc một số dân chúng gây nên" (caused by sections of the people or some
--      of the populace), without the popular-rising qualifier (VN-F2);
--  5.7 climbing: English "normally involving the use of ropes", Vietnamese "có sử dụng dây
--      thừng" (using ropes) (VN-F3);
--  5.7 aircraft: the English excludes any flight other than as a fare-paying passenger in a
--      properly licensed aircraft of a recognized airline; the Vietnamese excludes a fare-paying
--      passenger on an aircraft not validly licensed, of an airline not recognized (VN-F1).

